ent-ClothingLongcoatCentCommArmored = central command armored longcoat
    .desc = A royal green double-breasted longcoat with gold embellishments, specifically designed for a central command agent. Longcoats are fairly robust, offering some protection from the elements. It's been reinforced with a special alloy for some added protection.
ent-ClothingLongcoatCMO = chief medical officer's longcoat
    .desc = A double-breasted longcoat with a green cross, specifically designed for the chief medical officer. Cut-resistant fibers provide some measure of protection against infectious bites.
ent-ClothingLongcoatCE = chief engineer's longcoat
    .desc = A dark green double-breasted with LED strip trim, specifically designed for the chief engineer. Longcoats are fairly robust, offering some protection from the elements.
ent-ClothingLongcoatHoP = head of personnel's longcoat
    .desc = A navy blue double-breasted longcoat with red shoulderpads, specifically designed for the head of personnel. Longcoats are fairly robust, offering some protection from the elements.
